  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A shimmering spectral snake coils around your body for the duration. You gain 15 Temporary Hit Points; the spell ends early once you have no Temporary Hit Points left.</p><p>While the spell lasts, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Climbing.</strong> You have a Climb Speed equal to your Speed.</p><p><strong>Venomous Bite.</strong> As a Magic action, you can make a ranged spell attack with the snake against one creature within 50 feet. On a hit, the target takes 1d6 Force damage and has the &amp;Reference[poisoned apply=false]{Poisoned} condition until the start of your next turn; while Poisoned, it also has the &amp;Reference[incapacitated apply=false]{Incapacitated} condition.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> For each spell slot level above 3, the Temporary Hit Points increase by 5 and the damage of Venomous Bite by 1d6.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
